# Codegen is local-only

`.codegen/` must **never** be committed or pushed to GitHub.

- Keep `.codegen/` in `.gitignore`.
- Obtain or refresh the tool by copying from `zero-apps-codegen-scaffold` (do not move or delete files in the scaffold).
- Run `pnpm codegen:paths` after copying so merged config paths match this repo.
- Do not force-add `.codegen`, `codegen/`, or `**/zero_codegen/` to git.
